00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:05.320
So in life we have many different visible
temptations.

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:06.533
Let me explain to you what I mean.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:11.750
You can be with me and you can see me being
tempted with a girl to do something.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:13.549
Visually you can see it.

00:00:13.549 --> 00:00:16.000
You can see me being tempted to steal something.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.591
You can see me being tempted to do something
and get away with it.

00:00:20.591 --> 00:00:24.610
You can see me being tempted to do something
that's absolutely bad.

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:27.340
There are many different temptations in life.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:33.160
But as an entrepreneur, there is an invisible
temptation that when you go through, no one

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:35.970
is ever going to notice, but you.

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.910
And that's what stings.

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:41.960
