standards, no one feels it.

00:00:57.239 --> 00:00:59.310
No one sees it.

00:00:59.310 --> 00:01:01.390
No one can see it.

00:01:01.390 --> 00:01:02.390
Nothing.

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:03.970
